  "description": "Months (1-12) in which the item is listed in the Voedingscentrum 'Groente- en fruitkalender' (2023). The calendar is one column per month listing the vegetables (above a divider line) and fruit (below it) that are in season in that month. It has no further legend: it does not distinguish open field, greenhouse or storage produce and marks no peak season, so only 'months' is given. Footnote: compiled from Velt information, supplemented with insights from Bionext and the Voedingscentrum. The calendar label 'raap(steel)' (September, October) is applied to both 'Raap' and 'Raapsteel'. Items not listed are not covered by the source.",
